settings.together.relay_error = Needs a ws:// or wss:// address (no user name or query)
settings.together.relay_note = “Host via relay” runs the session through a music-relay server you host yourself (see the README: one small binary, put it behind a TLS reverse proxy for wss://). Guests then join from anywhere with the link. The relay forwards the session's messages (song ids, titles, names) but never decides anything; empty = LAN only.
