settings.cast.direct_desc = Off: this app streams it to the device (works with every song).
settings.cast.note = Casting plays the queue on a Chromecast, Google TV or Nest speaker on this network (Google's Default Media Receiver). The player bar's Cast button picks a device; play, pause, seek, skip and volume then control it, and Stop casting continues here. YouTube audio and local files are streamed from this computer to the device (keep the app open); the device and this computer must be on the same network. Changes apply to the next song.
